msgstr "Synthesize workspace findings"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/results.rst:53
msgid "跨实验比较与一致性"
msgstr "Comparisons and consistency across experiments"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/results.rst:55
msgid "前五个阶段按假设记录状态，``synthesis`` 单独记录工作区级状态。结构校验、阶段评议与研究者判断分别承担不同作用；门禁通过不等于结论已被科学验证。"
msgstr ""
"The first five phases track hypothesis-level state; ``synthesis`` has separate "
"workspace-level state. Structural validation, phase attestations, and researcher "
"judgment serve different purposes. Passing a gate does not scientifically validate a "
"conclusion."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/results.rst:57
msgid "在已初始化且同步分析技能的工作区，可查看分析状态："
msgstr "In an initialized workspace with the analysis skill synced, inspect its status:"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/results.rst:61
msgid "python .agentsociety/bin/ags.py analysis status --workspace . --hypothesis-id 1"
msgstr "python .agentsociety/bin/ags.py analysis status --workspace . --hypothesis-id 1"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/results.rst:63
msgid ""
"将编号替换为实际假设编号。需要 EDA 时按 :doc:`installation` 安装相应可选依赖；不必为每张表生成完整剖析。分析命令与 Python 接口见 "
":doc:`skills`。"
msgstr ""
"Replace the ID with the actual hypothesis ID. For EDA, install the relevant optional "
"dependencies following :doc:`installation`; not every table needs a full profile. See"
" :doc:`skills` for analysis commands and Python interfaces."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/results.rst:66
msgid "报告和过程文件"
msgstr "Reports and process files"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/results.rst:70
msgid ""
"presentation/hypothesis_<id>/\n"
"├── report_zh.md / report_zh.html\n"
"├── report_en.md / report_en.html\n"
"├── charts/\n"
"├── assets/\n"
"└── data/"
msgstr ""
"presentation/hypothesis_<id>/\n"
"├── report_zh.md / report_zh.html\n"
"├── report_en.md / report_en.html\n"
"├── charts/\n"
"├── assets/\n"
"└── data/"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/results.rst:77
msgid ""
"``charts/`` 保存图表，``assets/`` 保存报告引用的资源，``data/`` 保存分析数据。综合报告位于 "
"``synthesis/``；分析计划、发现与阶段状态保存在 ``.agentsociety/analysis/``，不要混入用户报告目录。"
msgstr ""
"``charts/`` stores charts, ``assets/`` stores report resources, and ``data/`` stores "
"analysis data. Synthesis reports live in ``synthesis/``. Plans, findings, and phase "
"state live in ``.agentsociety/analysis/`` and should not be mixed into user report "
"directories."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/results.rst:79
msgid "在项目树打开报告后，核对图表、资源链接与证据引用。分析结论应说明对应实验、参数、数据版本和适用范围；仿真中的行为模式不能直接当作现实世界的因果结论。"
msgstr ""
"Open reports in the project tree and check charts, asset links, and evidence "
"references. Conclusions should identify the experiment, parameters, dataset versions,"
" and scope. Simulated behavioral patterns are not direct causal conclusions about the"
" real world."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/results.rst:82
msgid "继续写作或修订"
msgstr "Continue writing or revise the study"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/results.rst:84
msgid ""
"报告确认后，外部 ``paper-toolkit`` 可读取研究产物继续论文写作，生成内容位于 ``paper/``。SDK "
"不内置论文生成器；需要在研究助手环境中安装并配置该工具链。"
msgstr ""
"After reports are confirmed, the external ``paper-toolkit`` can read research "
"artifacts and continue paper writing under ``paper/``. The SDK does not bundle a "
"paper generator; install and configure that toolchain in the research assistant "
"environment."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/results.rst:86
msgid ""
"若分析发现输入、测量或设计有问题，应回到相应数据、假设或配置阶段，重新运行并更新报告。修改报告文字不会修复上游实验数据，操作入口见 "
":doc:`research_workflow`。"
msgstr ""
"If analysis uncovers input, measurement, or design problems, return to the relevant "
"data, hypothesis, or configuration stage, rerun, and update reports. Editing report "
"prose does not repair upstream experiment data. See :doc:`research_workflow` for "
"entry points."
